### Health Check - Root
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Chat - Ask about clients
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "How many active clients do we have? with name"
}

### Chat - Ask about revenue
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Show me the revenue stats for this month"
}

### Chat - Ask about attendance
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Who checked in today?"
}

### Chat - Ask about trainers
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "List all trainers and their stats"
}

### Chat - Ask about expiring memberships
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Which memberships are expiring soon?"
}

### Chat - With conversation ID (for context)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Tell me more details",
  "conversation_id": "your-conversation-id-here"
}

### Delete Conversation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/chat/your-conversation-id-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Groq API Test
POST https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{groqKey}}

{
  "model": "llama-3.3-70b-versatile",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hello how are you?"
    }
  ]
}